WEBVTT

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:03.256
And then on top of all that,
you have digital technologies,

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:06.906
which change the way
that we interact with one another,

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:11.326
and also how those digital technologies
affect the actual experience of work.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:13.827
AG: Wait, none of that
is unique to millennials.

00:04:13.851 --> 00:04:15.085
AHP: That's fair.

00:04:15.109 --> 00:04:17.865
AG: You think it's fair?
I haven't even told you why yet.

00:04:17.889 --> 00:04:20.253
AHP: I think that it's OK
for people to disagree.

00:04:20.277 --> 00:04:23.866
Like, not everyone has to think
of their own experience in the same way.

00:04:23.890 --> 00:04:25.906
AG: I definitely agree with that.

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:27.081
AHP: OK.

00:04:27.105 --> 00:04:29.731
AG: So first of all,
how do you define burnout.

00:04:29.755 --> 00:04:36.596
AHP: Historically, it has been defined
as a feeling of giving up,